    "identifier": "medical-release-poisonous-blast",
    "description": "<p>You mold medical release chakra in your belly to imitate the heat and power of the Fire release nature transformation, before releasing it as a blast of sickly green or dark purple chakra from your hands or mouth.</p>\n<p>All creatures in a 10-foot radius sphere centered on a point you can see within range, must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, creatures take 2d8 poison damage and gain the Envenomed condition. On a successful save, creatures take half damage and no further effects.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, the damage by 1d8 and the radius of the sphere by 5 feet.</p>",
